@startuml
title Authentication -- SID 29 -- client-driven challenge-response (bidirectional)

participant Client
participant CDA
participant ECU

Client -> CDA : PUT /components/{ecu}/locks
CDA -> Client : lock acquired

Client -> CDA : PUT /modes/authentication\n{ "value": "requestChallengeForAuthentication", "parameters": { ... } }
CDA -> ECU : 29 05 {communicationConfiguration} {algorithmIndicator}
ECU -> CDA : 69 05 {returnParameter} {algorithmIndicator} {challengeServer} ...
CDA -> Client : HTTP 200 { "parameters": { "challengeServer": ..., ... } }

Client -> Client : sign challengeServer,\ncreate challengeClient\n(keys stay in the client)

Client -> CDA : PUT /modes/authentication\n{ "value": "verifyProofOfOwnershipBidirectional", "mode_expiration": 3600,\n"parameters": { proofOfOwnershipClient, challengeClient, ... } }
CDA -> ECU : 29 07 {algorithmIndicator} {proofOfOwnershipClient} {challengeClient} ...
ECU -> CDA : 69 07 {returnParameter} {proofOfOwnershipServer} ...
CDA -> CDA : tracked state = authenticated
note right of CDA : start mode_expiration timer (3600 s)
CDA -> Client : HTTP 200 { "parameters": { "proofOfOwnershipServer": ..., ... } }

Client -> Client : verify proofOfOwnershipServer

== authenticated diagnostic requests ==

Client -> CDA : PUT /modes/authentication\n{ "value": "deAuthenticate" }
CDA -> ECU : 29 00
ECU -> CDA : 69 00 {returnParameter}
CDA -> CDA : tracked state = deAuthenticated,\ncancel mode_expiration timer
CDA -> Client : HTTP 200

@enduml
